==========================================================
WHAT HAPPENS IF PORT 5173 IS BUSY?
==========================================================

If you already have another Vite project running, that
port will be busy. Vite will automatically pick the next
port:

Local:   http://localhost:5174/     <-- 5173 busy, switched to 5174

This is called "port juggling" — Vite smartly picks the
next available port.


